                 present in ThemePicker.strings. No English literals in code (registry mode/theme
                 names are data, exactly as the web renders `m.name` / `thm.name`).
  States       : loading (skeleton) · empty (friendly, never-blank) · error (retry → source.refresh)
                 · stale (chip + one-shot auto-refresh on the rising edge) · offline (cached + chip)
                 · ready. Every state renders.
  A11y         : VoiceOver labels on every interactive element (mode cards, accent swatches, Custom
